Jewish students must feel safe on campus.

Today, alongside 
@RishiSunak
 and 
@GillianKeegan
, I spoke to university leaders about ending antisemitism on campus and making sure that everyone is free to learn in safety.

@AberdeenSNP  botched-up the last budget, created public outcry, and now face court proceedings... 
